<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2919] Visor CMD: Add ability to attach custom scripts to alerts</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2919</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Visor cmd support &quot;alert&quot; command that allows to listen on particular triggers (heap usage, nodes count, ...).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If a trigger is fired Visor will print info into the log file. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However it makes sense specify a custom script that will be triggered when a trigger is fired.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
