                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15231842" author="vsisko" created="Fri, 8 Apr 2016 08:16:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Implemented execution of script on alert. &lt;br/&gt;
To configure use arguments:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;-n&lt;/b&gt; Alert name (opt.).&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;-s&lt;/b&gt; Path to script file.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;-i&lt;/b&gt; Minimal interval of script execution that should be passed&lt;br/&gt;
Script is executed on unsuccessful check of alert condition after successful. When alert check is unsuccessful longer than interval time script is not executed second time.&lt;br/&gt;
To script passed the next arguments: 1) Alert name, 2) alert condition, 3, ...) checked values of alert conditions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For example for script: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;alert -t=5 -r -n=Test -nc=gte2 -cc=lte16 -i=15 -s=/home/user/1.sh&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;with script:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeHeader panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.sh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;echo ALERT [$1] CONDITION [$2] alarmed with node count [$3] and cpu count [$4] &amp;gt; test.txt&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;will generated string: &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;ALERT [Test] CONDITION [-nc=gte2 -cc=lte16] alarmed with node count [2] and cpu count [8]&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15279426" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 11 May 2016 03:12:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I merged with master.&lt;br/&gt;
Please test as described in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2930&quot; title=&quot;Visor cmd: alert does not react on condition switch&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-2930&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-2930&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and fix VisorAlertCommandSpec.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15279688" author="vsisko" created="Wed, 11 May 2016 07:13:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Tested. Fixed test. Fixed exception handling.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15279908" author="pkonstantinov" created="Wed, 11 May 2016 10:27:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Suppressing works incorrect, the error message printed only once in the visor log.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15281173" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 12 May 2016 03:57:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed. Now alert try to execute script to first success.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15281311" author="pkonstantinov" created="Thu, 12 May 2016 08:13:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Please add info about default timeout for -t and -i options.&lt;br/&gt;
After that please assign to committer to merge into the target branch. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
